@@ -6,6 +6,13 @@ Changelog
 Unreleased
 ++++++++++
 
+- Overloads: The first overload that accepts all possible arguments of a call
+  is used, instead of combining all overloads. Results are only combined if no
+  overload matches. Arguments are compared with the usual typing rules and the
+  exact contents of tuple, list and dict literals (also when unpacked with
+  ``*``/``**``) are taken into account.
+- Support for ``Literal``
+
 0.20.1 (2026-10-12)
 +++++++++++++++++++
 
